Fixed. The bug was in clampToStorageCap at src/resources/storage.ts:22 — it clamped wood and stone to the storage cap but returned food unchanged, so food kept climbing past the cap every turn while wood/stone were correctly capped.

Changes:
- src/resources/storage.ts — food is now clamped with Math.min(resources.food, cap) like the other resources; removed the stale BUG note and the "still-buggy food case" comment in utilizationOf.
- tests/settlement.test.ts — added a regression test: a settlement at 49 food with 2 farms (net +6 food, would reach 55 > cap 50) now ends the turn at exactly 50.

Verification: npm run test passes (16/16, including the new test) and npm run typecheck (tsc --noEmit) is clean.


